ne, from farmers and workers, to kings and men of means, has a lot to say about this. How will you impact their lives? Use blunt magical force, find unorthodox solutions, or argue with everyone to the death, in an attempt to make sense of the changing world.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772710/extras/cf3ca069f16cfbcf1dad2a02be491100.poster.avif?t=1746119774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772710/extras/cf3ca069f16cfbcf1dad2a02be491100.webm?t=1746119774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772710/extras/cf3ca069f16cfbcf1dad2a02be491100.mp4?t=1746119774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/772710/extras/5d14a8449e355e7498279cbaa556314d.webp?t=1746119774\" /></div><br>Between your adventures, return to the corporate town, decorate your house, kick back beside the fireplace of the local tavern, and recount your feats to anyone who will listen. After all, don't we all deserve some recognition for our hard work?<br><br><br><br><strong>Early Access Note</strong><br>Fay\u2019s Factory is my handcrafted, story-based game, with no procedural generation. The game is in Early Access, and the story and a few features are incomplete. At this point, you can get 3-5 hours of adventuring out of it. If you still decide to support the development with your money and feedback, I will be forever grateful. But please, don\u2019t hesitate to wait until the release version \u2014 it will be the best one yet.<br><br><i>\u2014 egor</i>",
